# Wiki index

The catalog of the knowledge base. Every page under `pages/` is listed here,
grouped by category. `csdd wiki lint` flags pages missing from this index and
index entries pointing at missing files.

> **Entry format:** `- [Page Title](pages/<slug>.md) — one-line summary`.
> Keep entries under the right category heading; add categories as the base grows.

